      <p class="eyebrow mb-4 mt-6">Case Study · Fleet Operations</p>
      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Fleet Predictive Maintenance</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-ink/70">Fleet operators face unplanned downtime costing an estimated $448–760 per day per idle vehicle. MEAICON's edge AI platform processes vehicle telemetry on-device, detects developing faults before they cascade, and automates maintenance workflows — all without cloud round-trips or physical diagnostic visits.</p>
    </div>
